title dex: runtime boundaries and data owners
top to bottom direction
rectangle "Browser
React UI" as browser
rectangle "Telegram Bot API" as telegram
rectangle "Go control
HTTP + SSE + Telegram
Durable submissions + settings
Dream and automation checks
Worker process management" as control
rectangle "Bun worker
One pi-durable Harness per agent
Models + tools + ChatView
Memory extension" as worker
database "control.sqlite
Chats, submissions, settings
Automations and dream boundaries" as cdb
database "agents/<id>/state.sqlite
Runs, transcripts, tool calls" as adb
folder "Local agent files
agents/<id>/workspace
memory/ (shared Git repo)" as files
rectangle "Model providers" as models
browser --> control : HTTP commands
control --> browser : SSE transcript
telegram <--> control : Long poll + replies
control --> cdb : Control owns this data
control <--> worker : stdin/stdout NDJSON\nRequests + settled/chat events
worker --> adb : Worker owns this data
worker --> files : Tools + memory commits
worker --> models : Model requests
note bottom of control
  Stores a submission before delivery.
  Replays pending submissions after a worker restart.
end note
note bottom of worker
  Deduplicates submissions by request ID.
  Only this process opens agent storage.
end note
@enduml
